# Sync & Lineage Invariants

## Lineage
- Mapping rows: `content_asset_id` ↔ `source_section_id` (+ section version).
- Relationship: PRIMARY | SUPPORTING | REFERENCE | CUSTOM.
- CUSTOM / `syncPolicy=MANUAL` → warn, do not auto-recommend regenerate.

## Change detection
- Fingerprint = SHA-256 of normalized section text.
- Same hash ⇒ NO_CHANGE (skip impact).
- Section identity must be stable across versions (external_reference / stable section key).

## Impact
- Deterministic configurable rules first (typo/example/definition/formula/removed).
- Impact records are recommendations — instructor ACCEPT | REJECT | REGENERATE | IGNORE.

## Regeneration
- Create new `content_asset_version`; keep old until new is published.
- Never overwrite instructor-edited content silently when `manualModification=true`.
